                                                "sense_id": "e0ade4b0-1a75-3468-8f46-94c540d5616e",
                                                "text": "A few moments later, the A.D. reappears. \"They need you,\" she says. \"And could you stop by Wardrobe?\" Shannen rolls her eyes. \"O.K.!\" she snaps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
